  "releaseNotes": "## v1.11.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v1.10.0:\n\n- Split the entry point from the host configuration it builds ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Compose the test scratch paths with the typed path API ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Make the test scratch paths provably leaf-relative ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Add a headless test harness for SchemaEditor, and cover its logic (#128) ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Fix the build: drop SchemaEditor's unused Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp reference ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Flatten the nested ternary SonarCloud flagged in UpdateWindowTitle ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Keep the window title current, and ask before the window closes (#116) ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
